        "content": "<p>The following works only without the module system:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"bp\">..</span><span class=\"m\">4</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">succ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"bp\">..</span><span class=\"m\">5</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cbv</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>With <code>module</code> at the top it fails and the goal contains <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Fin.addNat%3F#doc\">docs#Fin.addNat?</a> that it can't reduce.<br>\nThis is probably because <code>UpwardEnumerable (Fin n)</code> is <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/53823a47ae0f4293bda3de80e99d7c12d3c2a78f/src/Init/Data/Range/Polymorphic/Fin.lean#L24-L26\">defined</a> using it.<br>\nCould you <code>@[expose]</code> <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Fin.addNat%3F#doc\">docs#Fin.addNat?</a></p>",
